          "message": {
            "text": "Synthetic file-control labels now enter renderTextAsPath, the same font resolution, glyph routing, shaping, and embedded-font/path funnel as document text. The fallback remains raw SVG text only when that shared renderer cannot resolve the run. The focused fixture reduced coverage from 0.1862% to 0.1787%; remaining regions are native-vs-vector raster AA and unrelated label/drop-zone edges, not a separate text implementation.",
            "markdown": "Synthetic file-control labels now enter renderTextAsPath, the same font resolution, glyph routing, shaping, and embedded-font/path funnel as document text. The fallback remains raw SVG text only when that shared renderer cannot resolve the run. The focused fixture reduced coverage from 0.1862% to 0.1787%; remaining regions are native-vs-vector raster AA and unrelated label/drop-zone edges, not a separate text implementation."
          },
